  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project cooperation -Improved utilization of Georgia&#x2019;s renewable energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected impact of the project cooperation is improved utilization of Georgia&#x2019;s renewable energy sources for economic development of the country. Expected outcome of the project is increased ability for Georgia to optimize their use of energy resources and become integrated in the European Energy Community, including improved energy market, improved decisions on environmental impact and a Renewable Energy Law.</narrative>
  </description>
